up to one target creature gets -2/-0 and loses flying.\n[−3]: Create a 4/4 blue Elemental Bird creature token with flying.\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Islands you control have \'{T}: Draw a card.\'"', '[+2]: You gain 2 life. Put two +1/+1 counters on up to one target creature.\n[−3]: Exile target creature. Its controller gains 2 life.\n[−10]: Creatures you control gain flying and double strike until end of turn.', '[0]: Put a loyalty counter on each red planeswalker you control.\n[0]: Create two 1/1 red Elemental creature tokens. They gain haste. Sacrifice them at the beginning of the next end step.\n[−2]: You may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.', '{1}, Sacrifice Ember Hauler: It deals 2 damage to any target.', '{1}, Sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "{1}, {T}: Choose a card name, then reveal the top card of your library. If that card has the chosen name, sacrifice Diviner's Lockbox and draw three cards. Activate only as a sorcery.", "{1}, {T}: Return target creature you control and each Aura attached to it to their owners' hands. Activate only during your turn.", "{1}, {T}: Untap another target artifact.\n{3}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{1}{G}: Frilled Sandwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn.\nWhen Cavalier of Flame enters the battlefield, discard any number of cards, then draw that many cards.\nWhen Cavalier of Flame dies, it deals X damage to each opponent and each planeswalker they control, where X is the number of land cards in your graveyard.', '{1}{R}: Each creature you control named Pack Mastiff gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{1}{R}{R}: Pyroclastic Elemental deals 1 damage to target player.', '{1}{U}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Vial of Dragonfire: It deals 2 damage to target creature.', '{2}: Add one mana of any color.', '{2}{B}: Knight of the Ebon Legion gets +3/+3 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a player lost 4 or more life this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Knight of the Ebon Legion. (Damage causes loss of life.)', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{B}{R}: Destroy target creature that was dealt damage this turn.', '{2}{W}: Moorland Inquisitor gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact or land: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Retributive Wand deals 1 damage to any target.\nWhen Retributive Wand is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, it deals 5 damage to any target.', '{5}{B}, {T}: Sorcerer of the Fang deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', '{5}{G}, {T}: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', "{5}{U}{U}: Frilled Sea Serpent can't be blocked this turn.", '{6}{B}: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', "{G}{G}{G}{G}{G}: Untap target land you control. It becomes a 5/5 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land. (This effect lasts as long as that land remains on the battlefield.)", '{R}: Goblin Bird-Grabber gains flying until end of turn. Activate only if you control a creature with flying.', '{T}, Pay 2 life, Discard a card, Sacrifice a creature: Create a 5/5 black Demon creature token with flying. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{T}: Target creature becomes the color or colors of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Cryptic Caves: Draw a card. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells or activate abilities of artifacts.\n{U}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Heart-Piercer Bow or Vial of Dragonfire, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}. If you control four or more creatures, add {G}{G} instead.', '{T}: Add {R}. Spend this mana only to cast an Elemental spell or a Chandra planeswalker spell.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control.', '{T}: You gain 1 life.']
